        "text": "### Help text stand out.\nUse strong **contrast** between text and its background.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c5863c52866fb31b0d8c3cfab13edae8-exec-3ab911a1-e5f8-4fe7-ae9f-51c1510e1b0d.png",
